---
import Download from '@lucide/astro/icons/download';
import { CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ALIAS_URL, CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ARCHIVE, CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DOWNLOAD_URL, CLAUDE_PLUGIN_VERSION } from '../../data/claude-plugin';
---

<section id="claude-plugin" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-20 rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-variant p-6">
  <div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
    <img src="/logo.png" alt="" width="32" height="32" class="size-8" />
    <h2 class="text-headline-sm text-foreground">Alera For Claude Web</h2>
    <span class="ml-auto rounded-pill border border-border px-2.5 py-1 text-label-md text-foreground-faint">v{CLAUDE_PLUGIN_VERSION}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="mb-5 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-foreground-muted">Upload To Customize &gt; Plugins In Claude Web. Includes Guided Setup, Workflow Skills, References, And The Remote Alera Connector.</p>
  <div data-plugin-installation class="mb-5 space-y-3 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-foreground-muted">
    <h3 class="text-title-md text-foreground">Compatibility And Installation</h3>
    <p>Requires A Paid Claude Plan. Upload The ZIP Or .plugin Through Customize &gt; Plugins. In The Plugin's Connectors Tab, Add And Connect Alera, Then Sign In Through OAuth.</p>
    <p>One User Reported Preliminary Claude Web Success With An Unidentified Experimental ZIP. This Does Not Verify Every Package Or A Complete OAuth Flow.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
    <a href={CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DOWNLOAD_URL} download={CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ARCHIVE} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-accent px-3.5 py-1.5 text-body-md font-medium text-on-accent transition-opacity duration-fast hover:opacity-90"><Download size={16} aria-hidden="true" />Download Claude Plugin ZIP</a>
    <a href={CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ALIAS_URL} download class="text-body-md text-foreground-faint underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-fast hover:text-foreground">Download .plugin</a>
    <a href="/docs/claude-plugin" class="text-body-md text-foreground-faint underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-fast hover:text-foreground">Claude Web Setup</a>
  </div>
</section>
